
# Public serve API: the clean path an app imports to start a server (never a `native/...` module). Re-exports the
# abstract transport, which the build rewrites to the target env's impl (node hono, rust axum, ...) via the native-env
# mechanism. The matching stays in the uniform router (`http/http`); only this transport differs per backend.

bear @term/site/code/http/native/{platform}/serve
